WEBVTT

00:01:28.043 --> 00:01:32.881
before he turns around to rescue more.

00:01:32.881 --> 00:01:36.088
I saw this, and I thought to myself,

00:01:36.088 --> 00:01:38.860
where do people like that come from?

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:41.903
What is that? That is some deep, deep emotion,

00:01:41.903 --> 00:01:43.604
when you would want to do that.

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:45.644
There's a love there,

00:01:45.644 --> 00:01:47.778
and I wanted to know why is it that

00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:50.462
I don't have people that I work with like that?

00:01:50.462 --> 00:01:51.880
You know, in the military, they give medals

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.502
to people who are willing to sacrifice themselves

00:01:54.502 --> 00:01:56.340
so that others may gain.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.268
In business, we give bonuses to people

00:01:58.268 --> 00:01:59.976
who are willing to sacrifice others

00:01:59.976 --> 00:02:01.470
so that we may gain.